fmodex for Debian
-----------------

FMOD Ex is only distributed as prebuilt binaries (i386 and amd64).

 * The 64-bit library is shipped upstream as libfmodex64-<version>.so; it is
   installed as libfmodex.so.4.44.64 for both architectures, with the
   libfmodex.so.4 (SONAME) and libfmodex.so (development) links.
 * The logging variant libfmodexL is not packaged: upstream builds it
   without a SONAME and nothing uses it.
 * Audio output libraries are loaded with dlopen(): ALSA (libasound.so.2)
   and PulseAudio (libpulse-simple.so.0). ESD is no longer available.
 * Programs can use "pkg-config --cflags --libs fmodex"; headers are in
   /usr/include/fmodex.

Written by Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>, reviewed by Nicolas HOUDELOT.

